          "eyebrow": "Orchestrionix by Decap",
          "title": "Orchestrionix: robotic instruments for musicians",
          "intro": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Orchestrionix is Decap's line of robotic instruments for musicians, made in our workshop in Herentals. It used to have its own website; decap.be is now the home of both. Today the line is Brass Core: real trumpet or trombone sound, driven by your own audio.",
