      {
        "variation": "default",
        "version": "initial",
        "items": [],
        "primary": {
          "eyebrow": "What makes it different",
          "title": "No music library. You supply the performance.",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Our self-playing instruments come with a player and music. Orchestrionix instruments do not. They are tools for musicians, sound designers and venues who want to drive a real acoustic instrument with their own material.",
              "spans": []
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Brass Core takes a line-level audio signal, from a recording or from MIDI through the sampler or synth of your choice. A voice-coil motor turns that signal into air vibrations at the mouthpiece, and the brass instrument itself shapes the tone. No drilling, no changes to the instrument.",
              "spans": []
            }
          ],
